      "definition": "(G) As used in this section, \"birth record\" has the same meaning as in section 3705.01 of the Revised Code.\n\n(H) Unless the court has reason to believe that a person named in the order is a potential victim of domestic violence, any order issued pursuant to this section finding the existence of a parent and child relationship shall contain the full names, addresses, and social security numbers of the mother and father of the child and the full name and address of the child.",
